ins the complete module inventory, build\n55\t  attestations, and test results covering every serving-stack image in scope,\n56\t  with no gaps against the inventories produced by the conversion work.\n57\t- The evidence package is submitted to the security review board and triaged\n58\t  to acceptance for progression to the external certification lab.\n59\t- The submission package is delivered to the external accredited certification\n60\t  lab.\n61\t\n62\t## HLR Traceability\n63\t\n64\t- HLR-2 (P0): \"A compliance evidence package (module inventory, build\n65\t  attestations, test results) is assembled and submitted through the security\n66\t  review board to the external certification lab.\"\n67\t- Consumes the HLR-1 deliverables (converted images and their per-image\n68\t  evidence inputs) from the conversion work.\n69\t\n70\t## Risks / Notes\n71\t\n72\t- The accredited lab's historical turnaround is six to nine months, and the\n73\t  security review board meets on its own cadence; both are externally\n74\t  controlled and cannot be compressed by engineering effort. They dominate the\n75\t  schedule and belong in delivery planning, not in this epic's acceptance\n76\t  criteria.\n77\t- The certification grant itself is the lab's decision; this epic's completion\n78\t  point is the assembled, review-board-triaged, lab-delivered package.\n79\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-893f1b092e44f041","agent_id":"a942642b9696894a4","session_id":"c0af6202-03d2-4ad7-8476-de2ac99e02dd","uuid":"7c61be3c-0a08-4201-9305-927708518f50","timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:12:51.690Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-928cc0e09bc43739","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
